Note that Translate Extension although powerful is not the only possibility 
for LMW. You are free to use i18n or just bare pages suffixed with language 
code (like papri/eng, papri/jbo etc.) Some people don't like Translate 
Extension and the main advantage for it is primarily for keeping 
multilingual CLL / L4B or their future revisions in sync for za'u pa 
languages.

Luckily we can keep rival extensions apart as they are not activated 
globally.

Also due to new visual Editor coming to MediaWiki, Translate Extension 
might suddenly go out of fashion until it is updated to work with this new 
editor.

